  "query_preview": "(Saturday through Tuesday)...\nA cooling trend is expected for Saturday into the middle of next\nweek as high pressure aloft weakens and a developing weak trough \nof low pressure near the California coast strengthens onshore \nlower-level flow. High temperatures will cool to around average\nfor next Monday with low temperatures cooling to slightly above\naverage. \n\nThere could be some increase in clouds and a chance of\nprecipitation around Tuesday or Wednesday of next week from\nmoisture from a tropical system that has yet to develop.",
